    "detailed_description": "This RPG is set in the expansive dungeon known as the 'Grand Labyrinth,' where you explore dungeons while leveling up your character. Centered around the story of the adventurer Barbara and a young man suffering from amnesia, the encounters and farewells with the diverse companions you meet in the labyrinth add a dramatic and exciting dimension to your adventure. What awaits you in the deepest recesses of the labyrinth? Tough bosses, hidden elements, and completion of coveted treasures also contribute to the rich gameplay experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe gameplay time is approximately 8 hours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis work is a remake of the game 'Abyss Seeker,' which won the grand prize at the official RPG Maker Fes event, now adapted to RPG Maker MZ.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl Instructions<br />\r\nZ Button: Confirm, Fast Forward<br />\r\nX Button: Open Menu Screen, Cancel<br />\r\nArrow Keys: Move Character<br />\r\nShift Key: Dash<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJapanese language only.",
